  <Docs>
    <summary>The InCallService extends this class to provide a means of receiving callbacks from the Connection.VideoProvider.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>The InCallService extends this class to provide a means of receiving callbacks from the Connection.VideoProvider.</para>
      <para>When the InCallService receives the Call.Callback.onVideoCallChanged(Call,VideoCall) callback, it should create an instance its VideoCall.Callback implementation and set it on the VideoCall using VideoCall.registerCallback(Callback).</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telecom/InCallService.VideoCall.Callback" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telecom.InCallService.VideoCall.Callback</code>.</a></format></para>
