        <param name="videoProfile">The requested video profile.</param>
        <summary>Called when the Connection.VideoProvider receives a session modification request from the peer device.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Called when the Connection.VideoProvider receives a session modification request from the peer device.</para>
          <para>The InCallService may potentially prompt the user to confirm whether they wish to accept the request, or decide to automatically accept the request. In either case the InCallService should call VideoCall.sendSessionModifyResponse(VideoProfile) to indicate the video profile agreed upon.</para>
